    "请选择当前用户目录，用于读取本地中文研究报告。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Choose the current user directory to read local research reports."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"请选择当前用户目录，用于读取本地中文研究报告。"}}}},
