    "这是运行前形成的完整拟提交合同。研究者可以在执行前审查全部参数，并用 RunSpec 哈希核对提交前后是否一致。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This is the complete pre-run submission contract. Review every parameter before execution and use the RunSpec hash to verify that the submitted configuration is unchanged."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"这是运行前形成的完整拟提交合同。研究者可以在执行前审查全部参数，并用 RunSpec 哈希核对提交前后是否一致。"}}}},
    "这是服务器实际接受并用于执行的冻结配置。它是结果证据的身份与来源依据，不是统计结果本身。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This is the frozen configuration accepted and executed by the server. It identifies the source of result evidence; it is not the statistical result itself."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"这是服务器实际接受并用于执行的冻结配置。它是结果证据的身份与来源依据，不是统计结果本身。"}}}},
    "运行前拟提交配置（完整）" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Complete pre-run submission configuration"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"运行前拟提交配置（完整）"}}}},
